cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you build on this starter kit in a publication, a course or another repository, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ECC-to-CAP Starter Kit"
abstract: >-
  A reference path from a running SAP ECC system to a first clean-core extension
  with the SAP Cloud Application Programming Model (CAP): a read-only CAP service
  that consumes ECC's SAMPLEFLIGHT OData V2 service through SAP Gateway, the
  Cloud Connector and a destination, with a Fiori elements UI, a mock mode that
  needs no backend, and a contract test for the CAP-to-Gateway translation.
authors:
  - given-names: Sebastiano
    family-names: Marchesini
    website: "https://sebastianomarchesini.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastianomarchesini/ecc-to-cap-starter-kit"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - SAP
  - SAP ECC
  - SAP Cloud Application Programming Model
  - CAP
  - OData
  - SAP Gateway
  - Fiori elements
  - Cloud Foundry
  - clean core
  - S/4HANA migration
